<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3791/96 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6975/80 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9101/11 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4125/35 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.04/05  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7355/70   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1684.0/4.5  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.41/51   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7151/25   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0718/90   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4639/67   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6385/90</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$345.25/75</p>
